---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Do you charge a call-out fee?',
    a: 'Never. Driving out, diagnosing and quoting costs you nothing. You’re only billed the fixed price you approve, and only once we actually start work.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can you come today?',
    a: 'Most days, yes, for homes across Brisbane’s southside and Logan. Call before midday for the best chance of a same-day plumbing slot, and genuine emergencies (flood, burst pipe or gas smell) are always triaged first.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Are you licensed and insured?',
    a: 'Fully. We hold QBCC licence 1234567 and carry $20 million in public liability insurance. Every gas job leaves with a compliance certificate, and we can produce both documents before we start.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What will it cost?',
    a: 'Repairs are quoted as a fixed price before we start, so the number you approve is the number you pay. As a guide, drain clearing starts at $189 and hot-water installs begin at $1,090. Your exact quote is always confirmed on site first.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you work after hours?',
    a: 'We run Monday to Saturday until 7pm, and take by-arrangement call-outs for floods, burst pipes and gas smells. If your job can safely wait for morning, an honest plumber will tell you.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Which suburbs do you cover?',
    a: 'All of Brisbane’s south through to Logan: Mount Gravatt, Carindale, Coorparoo, Sunnybank, Rochedale, Springwood, Logan Central, Browns Plains, Beenleigh and everywhere in between.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can you clear a blocked drain without digging?',
    a: 'Most of the time, yes. CCTV drain cameras locate the blockage and jet blasting clears sinks, showers and sewers without trenching up your yard. If a pipe is broken, we show you the footage and quote the repair on the spot.',
  },
];

const faqLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faqs.map(({ q, a }) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: q,
    acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: a },
  })),
};
---

<section id="faq" class="section section-alt" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--center">Before you call</p>
      <h2 id="faq-heading">Straight answers, no plumber-speak.</h2>
      <p>The questions Brisbane and Logan households ask us most.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list">
      {faqs.map(({ q, a }) => (
        <details class="card faq-item">
          <summary>
            {q}
            <span class="faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
              <Icon name="chevron" />
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-body">{a}</div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqLd)} />
</section>
